      "text": "This never gets old (& also shows how hard forecasting AI is even for AI)\n\n“Hey Claude Fable & GPT-6 Astra, Without looking anything up, when do you think we will solve the Exponential Time Hypothesis?” (I only show part of the answers for space)",
